<title>USA: A.O. Smith completes UPPCO acquisition.</title>
<headline>A.O. Smith completes UPPCO acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE, Wis. 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.O. Smith Corp said Monday it completed the acquisition of UPPCO Inc of Monticello, Ind. Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>UPPCO manufactures sub-fractional horsepower C-frame motors. It forecasts 1997 sales will reach about $80 million, and revenues have grown at an annual rate of 13 percent over the last five years.</p>
<p>UPPCO's motors are used in bathroom and range hood fans, pumps, microwave and convection ovens and medical equipment.</p>
<p>A.O. Smith is a diversified manufacturer.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
